{"pageid":3321,"title":"Lunar Staff","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Lunar Staff</span>","revid":19984,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><big><i>\"A staff made of pure rock, moon rock! Control matter around you, levitate items, make others bow down before you!\"</i></big>\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default type-wood\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"optionalTitle\">Lunar Staff</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/a/ae/Lunar_Staff.png/revision/latest?cb=20241011182305\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Lunar Staff\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/a/ae/Lunar_Staff.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20241011182305\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/a/ae/Lunar_Staff.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20241011182305 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/a/ae/Lunar_Staff.png/revision/latest?cb=20241011182305 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Lunar Staff\" width=\"228\" height=\"500\" data-image-key=\"Lunar_Staff.png\" data-image-name=\"Lunar Staff.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tStats\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Function\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Function</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Allows you to pick up even more objects at once for longer.</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.68.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">October 4th, 2024</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Lunar Staff</b> is a tool that was added in the <b>2024 Halloween Event</b> that can be crafted by placing a <b><a href=\"/wiki/Hardened_Moon_Rod\" title=\"Hardened Moon Rod\">Hardened Moon Rod</a></b> and a <b><a href=\"/wiki/Moon_Shard\" title=\"Moon Shard\">Moon Shard</a></b> on the altar found at the top of the <b><a href=\"/wiki/The_Manor\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"The Manor\">Manor</a></b>. The type of <b>Moon Shard</b> used to craft the <b>Lunar Staff</b> must be the <b>Full Moon</b>. It allows the user to project a medium-sized zone that lets them pick up multiple loose objects similar to the <a href=\"/wiki/Grabby_Grabber\" title=\"Grabby Grabber\"><b>Grabby</b> <b>Grabber</b></a> and the <a href=\"/wiki/Grabbiest_Grabber\" title=\"Grabbiest Grabber\"><b>Grabbiest</b> <b>Grabber</b></a>.It can hold objects for 5 minutes.      \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Lunar Staff</b> can grab heavier objects than the <b><a href=\"/wiki/Grabbiest_Grabber\" title=\"Grabbiest Grabber\">Grabbiest Grabber</a></b> and <b><a href=\"/wiki/Grabby_Grabber\" title=\"Grabby Grabber\">Grabby Grabber</a></b>.\n</p><p>The <b>Lunar Staff</b>  has a longer range than the <b><a href=\"/wiki/Grabbiest_Grabber\" title=\"Grabbiest Grabber\">Grabbiest Grabber</a></b> and <b><a href=\"/wiki/Grabby_Grabber\" title=\"Grabby Grabber\">Grabby Grabber</a></b>.\n</p>\n<ul><li class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903163407\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.029 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.035 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 63/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 65/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.006/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019473/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   26.403      1 Template:Objects\n100.00%   26.403      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:3321-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260903163407 and revision id 19984. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Limited","Tools","Objects","Items"],"links":[{"title":"Grabbiest Grabber","exists":true},{"title":"Grabby Grabber","exists":true},{"title":"Hardened Moon Rod","exists":true},{"title":"Moon Shard","exists":true},{"title":"The Manor","exists":true}],"images":["Lunar_Staff.png"]}
